# wild - photoreal tag library
Source of truth. Generator: tools/gen_wild.py <model> <skin> <hair>.
No pose axis. One file per environment; the realm supplies the environment.
Never edit the .txt files - regenerate.

[quality]
masterpiece, best quality, absurdres, photorealistic, raw photo

[anatomy]
1girl, solo, female adult mid-twenties, medium build, head to body ratio 1 to 7

[frame]
full body, standing, feet in frame, full figure

[body.nude]
completely nude, uncensored, hardcore, breasts, nipples, navel, vagina, labia

